# 👩‍💻 Personal Portfolio

A personal portfolio website showcasing my skills, projects, education, and achievements.

## ✨ Features

- Personal introduction
- Skills section
- Projects section
- Education details
- Achievements and certifications
- Contact information
- Responsive design

## 🛠️ Technologies Used

- HTML5
- CSS3

## 🎯 Purpose

This portfolio was created to showcase my technical skills, projects, education, and achievements while building my career in Computer Science and Artificial Intelligence.

